  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4402.12 Refinery",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4402.12 “Refinery” means any facility used to process crude oil, unfinished oils, natural gas liquids or other hydrocarbons into any accountable product/motor fuel.\n\nSource. #10021, eff 11-9-11 (from Saf-C 4402.05); ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4402.11)",
